entries.content:
Any NPCs that appear in a character's storyline, or new NPCs that appear in searches, etc., must be inserted into <roletab> and {roletips} using the following format; outputting only the NPC name in {{char}} is strictly forbidden:

FORMAT:{tname::NPC名字::tdata::NPC个人介绍+属性数据}

eg:{tname::人物名字::tdata::人物介绍/血量:xx/体力:xx/攻击:xx/防御:xx/速度:xx/智慧:xx/魅力:xx}

所有NPC必须有名字，根据当前世界观，找到对应的小说参考人名，必须根据NPC实力定义角色属性值。

